          "type": "text",
          "options": [],
          "steps": [
            "Step 1: Shift pronoun 'I' to 'she'.",
            "Step 2: Backshift 'am studying' (Present Cont.) to 'was studying' (Past Cont.).",
            "Step 3: Shift time expression 'today' to 'that day'.",
            "Step 4: Mary said that she was studying for her exams that day."
          ],
          "why": "Pronouns shift to third person, present continuous backshifts to past continuous, and 'today' changes to 'that day'.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Shift pronoun 'I' to 'she'.\nStep 2: Backshift 'am studying' (Present Cont.) to 'was studying' (Past Cont.).\nStep 3: Shift time expression 'today' to 'that day'.\nStep 4: Mary said that she was studying for her exams that day.",
