          "why": "Zero conditional uses present simple in both clauses to state general scientific truths and facts.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Check verb tenses: 'reaches' (present) and 'boils' (present).\nStep 2: Note that this expresses a scientific law and certainty.\nStep 3: It is a Zero Conditional sentence.",
