          "sol": "Step 1: Name the subject discussed throughout the passage.\nStep 2: Combine the benefits mentioned into a statement about that subject.\nStep 3: Make sure the main idea is a complete sentence.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Main Ideas.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "reading_comprehension",
          "topic": "Main Ideas",
          "conceptId": "english_reading_comprehension_main_ideas",
