          "why": "Supporting details develop the main idea by giving specific examples, actions or evidence.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Consider whether the sentence describes the entire passage or only one event.\nStep 2: Identify the broader activity that connects the different details.\nStep 3: Explain how Amina's costume contributes to that broader activity.",
