          "sol": "Step 1: Read the main idea and identify its subject: exercise and physical fitness.\nStep 2: Check which details describe physical activities or their benefits.\nStep 3: Reject details that do not explain or demonstrate the main idea.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Supporting Details.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "reading_comprehension",
          "topic": "Supporting Details",
          "conceptId": "english_reading_comprehension_supporting_details",
