          "why": "Greetings and courteous expressions help reveal both the intended audience and the writer's attitude.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Look at the greeting to identify who is being addressed.\nStep 2: Examine expressions such as 'kindly' and 'thank you for your cooperation'.\nStep 3: Use those clues to describe the relationship and attitude conveyed.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Audience and Tone.",
