          "q": "A report says, 'The new school timetable caused three learners to miss their buses. Therefore, the timetable is a complete failure.' Explain why the conclusion may be biased or unfairly one-sided, and state what further information would help.",
          "ans": "The conclusion may be unfairly one-sided because it judges the entire timetable using only three reported cases. Useful additional information would include how many learners use the buses, how often the problem occurs, whether the timetable has other benefits and what caused the missed buses.",
