          "why": "Relevant details should contribute directly to the explanation the writer is trying to develop.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Focus on the purpose: preventing the spread of infectious diseases.\nStep 2: Choose actions that can reduce the transmission of germs.\nStep 3: Exclude details that describe the school but do not help prevent infection.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Selecting Relevant Information.",
