          "why": "'At this point in time' can be replaced by nothing here, and 'in the afternoon' repeats information already expressed by p.m.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify expressions that repeat the same meaning.\nStep 2: Keep the essential information: the meeting time.\nStep 3: Rewrite the sentence using direct wording.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Removing Unnecessary Details.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "summary_note_making",
          "topic": "Removing Unnecessary Details",
