          "steps": [
            "Step 1: Notice that the same person performs both actions.",
            "Step 2: Avoid repeating the person's name unnecessarily.",
            "Step 3: Join the two actions using 'and' while keeping the sentence clear."
          ],
          "why": "Combining related actions can make writing smoother and more concise without losing information.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Notice that the same person performs both actions.\nStep 2: Avoid repeating the person's name unnecessarily.\nStep 3: Join the two actions using 'and' while keeping the sentence clear.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Combining Related Ideas.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "summary_note_making",
          "topic": "Combining Related Ideas",
          "conceptId": "english_summary_note_making_combining_related_ideas",
