          "sol": "Step 1: Establish the scene and its activity.\nStep 2: Include details that can be seen and heard.\nStep 3: Add another relevant sensory detail, such as smell.\nStep 4: Check that all sentences contribute to the same scene.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Descriptive Composition.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "paragraph_composition_writing",
          "topic": "Descriptive Composition",
          "conceptId": "english_paragraph_composition_writing_descriptive_composition",
          "skillId": "english_paragraph_composition_writing",
