          "sol": "Step 1: State the main relationship between trees and soil erosion.\nStep 2: Explain how roots affect the soil.\nStep 3: Explain how leaves or ground cover can reduce the impact of rain.\nStep 4: Connect the details to the result.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Expository Composition.",
