          "sol": "Step 1: Decide whether you agree, disagree or partly agree.\nStep 2: State your position directly.\nStep 3: Select two distinct reasons and briefly explain each.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Argumentative Composition.",
          "subject": "english",
