          "why": "A CV profile should communicate relevant strengths clearly rather than focus on desperation or exaggerated promises.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Remove unsupported claims such as being able to do anything.\nStep 2: Identify skills relevant to office assistance.\nStep 3: State the applicant's strengths and purpose professionally.",
