          "q": "Explain why a learner should ask permission before listing a teacher as a referee on a CV.",
          "ans": "The learner should ask permission because the teacher may be contacted and asked to comment on the learner's suitability. Permission respects the teacher's time and privacy and allows the learner to confirm that the teacher is willing and able to provide a reference.",
