          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the information being communicated.\nStep 2: Consider whether the speaker is mainly entertaining, persuading, warning or giving practical information.\nStep 3: Use the content of the statement to justify your choice.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Identifying Speaker Purpose and Attitude.",
