          "q": "Rewrite this disagreement respectfully: 'That plan is stupid, and anyone who supports it is wrong.'",
          "ans": "I respectfully disagree with the plan because it may cost more than the group can afford. Could we consider a less expensive alternative?",
          "type": "text",
