          "why": "Requesting clarification demonstrates careful listening and helps prevent misunderstandings.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Recognise that guessing could lead to an irrelevant answer.\nStep 2: Remain polite and show that you want to understand the question.\nStep 3: Ask the interviewer to repeat or clarify it.\nStep 4: Listen carefully, then answer the clarified question.",
