          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the words carrying the main information.\nStep 2: Identify function words that are often less prominent.\nStep 3: Explain how alternating prominence creates a speech pattern.\nStep 4: Describe how this pattern helps the listener follow the sentence.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Rhythm.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "pronunciation_spoken_english",
          "topic": "Rhythm",
          "conceptId": "english_pronunciation_spoken_english_rhythm",
