          "sol": "Step 1: Choose a practical collaborative activity.\nStep 2: Make one suggestion using 'Why don't we ...?'\nStep 3: Make another using 'We could ...'.\nStep 4: Ensure that both suggestions address the same goal.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Advice and Suggestions.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "language_functions_register",
          "topic": "Advice and Suggestions",
          "conceptId": "english_language_functions_register_advice_and_suggestions",
          "skillId": "english_language_functions_register",
          "subskillId": "english_language_functions_register_q2"
