          "sol": "Step 1: Identify what emotional language can do for an audience.\nStep 2: Explain the role of evidence in supporting a claim.\nStep 3: Compare the credibility of the two approaches.\nStep 4: Describe how emotion and evidence can be combined responsibly.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Persuasion and Negotiation.",
          "subject": "english",
          "chapter": "language_functions_register",
          "topic": "Persuasion and Negotiation",
          "conceptId": "english_language_functions_register_persuasion_and_negotiation",
